<view class="page">
  <view class="kicker">故事核海报</view>
  <view class="title">先看这一幕，值不值得拍下去。</view>

  <view class="poster">
    <image wx:if="{{input.imagePath}}" class="poster-bg" src="{{input.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
    <view class="shade"></view>
    <view class="poster-content">
      <text class="poster-brand">桃紫有光 · 大圣故事工坊</text>
      <text class="poster-title">{{story.title}}</text>
      <text class="poster-core">{{story.core}}</text>
      <text class="poster-slogan">{{story.slogan}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">正式版会基于这张故事核画面生成艺术化书法海报，并锁定后续视频的视觉方向。</view>
  <view class="actions">
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="regenerate">换一个</button>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="confirm">确认这个故事　→</button>
  </view>
</view>